TOAST table "pg_toast.pg_toast_2619"
   Column   |  Type   
------------+---------
 chunk_id   | oid
 chunk_seq  | integer
 chunk_data | bytea
Owning table: "pg_catalog.pg_statistic"
Indexes:
    "pg_toast_2619_index" PRIMARY KEY, btree (chunk_id, chunk_seq)

